# The repo root is the docker build context of the guest's snapshot build
# (cartesi.toml, at the root, sets context = "." so the bun workspace resolves
# inside the build) and of the devnet's own images. Keep the context down to
# what those builds read.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
.cartesi
devnet/snapshot
devnet/deployment
contracts/out
contracts/cache
contracts/dependencies
bin
op-cartesi
